# the reseed entropy || reseed additional input.
#
# The remaining vectors cover empty inputs and a range of output lengths,
# including ones which are not a multiple of the block size. These were
# computed with an independent Python implementation which was first checked
# against all of the ACVP CTR_DRBG AES vectors.

